## 2. `CHANGELOG.md` – Version History

```markdown
# Changelog

All notable changes to **Anti Social Network** (landing page and apps) will be documented here.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

---

## [0.1.0] – 2026-08-09

### Added
- **Initial launch** of the Anti Social Network landing page.
- **Five apps** showcased: SHROUD, DRIFT, TRADE, PULSE, BLOOM, plus SECRET teaser.
- **Interactive overlays**:
  - FAQ with four questions about the project’s ethos.
  - Build‑your‑own‑social‑media guide (click the `+`).
  - Download overlay with direct links for Desktop and Android.
  - PayPal subscription integration (dollar sign in top‑right).
- **Access gates** for three apps:
  - **BLOOM** – Florida ZIP code challenge.
  - **DRIFT** – daily coding puzzle (numeric addition).
  - **PULSE** – age verification (born in 2007 or later).
  - **TRADE** – embed click challenge (random clicks to unlock).
- **Glitch‑themed visual effects**: scanlines, vignette, animated particles, neon glitch text.

### Known Issues
- macOS, Linux, and iOS download links are placeholders – only Windows and Android APKs are available.
- SHROUD and SECRET are not yet downloadable – they are placeholders for future releases.

---

## [0.0.1] – 2026-07-15

### Added (Prototype)
- Internal prototype of the landing page.
- Basic card layout with placeholder icons.
